# Generated weak-password denylist (SJ-7). The generator is committed; its
# output is not — a file of 11k passwords trips the gitleaks secret-scan job,
# and allowlisting a directory to silence that would hide a real leak landing
# there. Regenerate with:
#   node infra/wordlists/generate-weak-passwords.mjs > infra/wordlists/breached-passwords.txt
infra/wordlists/*.txt
